      "text": "How Can I Get My Baby to Move in Utero?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 6,
      "heading_id": "heading_00001",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Kick Counts"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 7,
      "heading_id": "heading_00002",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Key Takeaways"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 11,
      "heading_id": "heading_00003",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "What are some ways to encourage my baby's movement?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 13,
      "heading_id": "heading_00004",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "1. Have a snack."
    },
    {
      "block_index": 20,
      "heading_id": "heading_00005",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "2. Do some jumping jacks, then sit down"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 23,
      "heading_id": "heading_00006",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "3. Gently poke or jiggle your baby bump."
    },
    {
      "block_index": 26,
      "heading_id": "heading_00007",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "4. Shine a flashlight on your tummy."
    },
    {
      "block_index": 29,
      "heading_id": "heading_00008",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "5. Lie down."
    },
    {
      "block_index": 34,
      "heading_id": "heading_00009",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "6. Talk to baby."
    },
    {
      "block_index": 37,
      "heading_id": "heading_00010",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "7. Do something that makes you nervous (within reason)."
    },
    {
      "block_index": 40,
      "heading_id": "heading_00011",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "8. Sing a lullaby or turn up the music (just not too loud)."
    },
    {
      "block_index": 47,
      "heading_id": "heading_00012",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "What if I can't get my baby to move?"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 50,
      "heading_id": "heading_00013",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Counting Kicks"
    }
  ],
